# Exceptions: the `.nc` files under
# `src/legoesm/atmosphere/physics/radiation/rrtmgp/optics/rrtmgp_data/`
# are package-bundled optics tables that must be tracked for RRTMGP
# radiation to work.  The `src/legoesm/ml/data/` Python source is
# library code that happened to match the `data/` exclude.  Both
# have been tracked in history despite matching the patterns above;
# add explicit negations so they survive a hypothetical `git clean
# -X` and don't confuse `git ls-files -i -c`.
!src/legoesm/atmosphere/physics/radiation/rrtmgp/optics/rrtmgp_data/*.nc
!src/legoesm/ml/data/
!src/legoesm/ml/data/**
